%% CURRENT prod,remote diagram; UC03 购物车、外卖下单、支付与取消; services: order-service + merchant-service + RabbitMQ
flowchart LR
    U[用户]
    BFF[backend BFF\nCart/Order workflow ports]
    ORD[order-service\n订单、支付、Saga]
    ODB[(order DB\n10 tables)]
    MQ[(RabbitMQ\nOutbox / Inbox)]
    MER[merchant-service\n库存所有者]
    MDB[(merchant DB)]
    U -->|购物车 / 下单 / 支付 / 取消| BFF
    BFF -->|命令与商品快照| ORD
    BFF -->|商品与优惠查询| MER
    ORD --> ODB
    ORD -->|reserve request| MQ
    MQ --> MER
    MER --> MDB
    MER -->|reserve result| MQ
    MQ --> ORD
    ORD -->|状态 / 幂等结果| BFF
    BFF --> U
